{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/3.gif?t=1750686791\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Nest is a first-person psychological horror adventure game that blends a walking simulator and point-and-click mechanics, all within a dark and psychological atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist ventures into a secluded mansion <strong>to find Sofia's manuscript.</strong> You will need to <strong>carefully examine this mansion and discover hidden clues to progress the narrative.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark and Atmospheric Environments</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Detailed and Realistic Soundscapes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather Clues Through Varied Interactions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Something Lurks Within the Mansion...</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/1.gif?t=1750686791\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/2.gif?t=1750686791\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751330?t=1750686791","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/b6ba205463993598cf75e8d7483aba15066db56a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750686791","capsule_image":"htt